ttf-jigmo (Japanese Kanji font set)

Jigmo fonts are free kanji fonts. The KAGE system, Clipper, FontForge
and TTX are used to create thise fonts. All glyphs in these fonts are
from GlyphWiki.

Jigmo fonts contains 145,973 characters (and spaces) defined in the
ISO/IEC 10646 standard / the Unicode standard.
